WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:08.866
If two Trainers' eyes happen to meet, the rule is they have a battle!

2
00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:11.299
Yeah, I agree. I'm Ash.

3
00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:14.266
- This is my friend, Pikachu.
- Pikachu!

4
00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.633
Uh, is that really a rule?

5
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.000
I'm not so sure it's a hard and fast rule,

6
00:00:19.066 --> 00:00:20.966
but it is pretty standard stuff.

7
00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:25.066
My name's Penelope. Sylveon, come on out!

8
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.799
I've never seen that Pokémon.

9
00:00:29.866 --> 00:00:31.933
Sylveon!

10
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.766
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

11
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:38.333
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

12
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.166
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

13
00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:44.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

14
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

15
00:00:47.366 --> 00:00:50.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

16
00:00:50.566 --> 00:00:53.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

17
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

18
00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:58.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

19
00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:02.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

20
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:13.300
On their way to Cyllage City

21
00:01:13.366 --> 00:01:15.666
and Ash's second Kalos Gym badge challenge,

22
00:01:15.733 --> 00:01:18.033
our heroes have met a Trainer named Penelope,

23
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.266
who has just challenged Ash to a battle in the forest.

24
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:23.633
It looks kind of like Espeon.

25
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.399
Sylveon, the Intertwining Pokémon and an evolved form of Eevee.

26
00:01:27.466 --> 00:01:29.933
Sylveon affectionately wraps its ribbon-like feelers

27
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.133
around its Trainer's arm as they walk together.

28
00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:36.233
Wow. So it is an evolved form of Eevee after all.

29
00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:40.466
Hey Ash, did you know that Sylveon is a Fairy-type Pokémon?

30
00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.266
No. Fairy type?

31
00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:45.666
- Yeah. Dedenne's a Fairy type, too.
- Nenne.

32
00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:49.533
That's pretty cool stuff, a new type, a new Pokémon.

33
00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.133
All right, Froakie, I choose you!

34
00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:55.300
Froakie!

35
00:01:58.366 --> 00:02:00.600
- Promise me something.
- Huh?

36
00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:04.766
If I happen to beat you in our battle, you're coming with me, sweetie.

37
00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:08.666
Is she serious? Her and Ash? No way!

38
00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:11.033
Sure, but there's no way I'm going to lose.

39
00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.966
All right, Froakie. Attack with Bubble!

40
00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.466
Kie! Fro!

41
00:02:17.466 --> 00:02:19.799
Sylveon, use Fairy Wind!

42
00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.666
Whoa! Froakie?

43
00:02:26.733 --> 00:02:29.200
That Fairy Wind stopped Bubble.

44
00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:34.033
- Froakie, are you able to get up?
- Fro! Fro! Fro! Froakie!

45
00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.766
- Sylveon, Moonblast, let's go!
- Syl!

46
00:02:43.799 --> 00:02:45.466
Froakie, jump!

47
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.533
Quick, knock them all down!

48
00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:58.233
- Ha! Just a decoy!
- Huh?

49
00:02:58.299 --> 00:03:02.033
- Water Pulse!
- Froakie!

50
00:03:04.233 --> 00:03:06.833
- Way to go, Froakie!
- You okay, Sylveon?

51
00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.166
Yeah.

52
00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:11.233
- Okay, it's time to wrap this up!
- Froakie!

53
00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:14.033
All right, Sylveon, use Attract!

54
00:03:17.266 --> 00:03:19.299
Fro?

55
00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:23.966
- Froakie, no!
- Fro!

56
00:03:25.866 --> 00:03:27.566
Froakie!

57
00:03:27.633 --> 00:03:30.466
Wow! It looks like Attract worked!

58
00:03:30.533 --> 00:03:32.566
- Dedenne.
- This is bad.

59
00:03:32.633 --> 00:03:36.799
I've never seen Froakie acting so weird like that before.

60
00:03:36.866 --> 00:03:39.566
- Froakie, snap out of it!
- Pika! Pika!

61
00:03:39.633 --> 00:03:42.600
All right. Now, use Draining Kiss!

62
00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:46.766
-Froakie! Froakie!

63
00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:52.466
- Huh?

64
00:03:52.533 --> 00:03:55.000
- Froakie!
- Pika!

65
00:03:55.066 --> 00:03:58.066
You okay?

66
00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:03.266
Obviously, Draining Kiss drained all of Froakie's energy.

67
00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:05.466
Froakie's unable to battle. That's it.

68
00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:07.700
Here, take this Oran Berry. It'll help.

69
00:04:07.766 --> 00:04:11.433
Penelope, thanks a lot. Here, Froakie. Eat this.

70
00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.299
- Well, I won.
- Huh?

71
00:04:13.366 --> 00:04:16.333
So now you have to keep your word, sweetie, and come with me.

72
00:04:16.399 --> 00:04:20.833
Huh. She's serious! You're going to go with her?

73
00:04:20.899 --> 00:04:23.333
Whee!

74
00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:33.233
- I'm back, children!
- Hey, it's Miss Penelope!

75
00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:39.000
- Look at all the kids!
- Pika!

76
00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:42.466
This looks like some sort of kindergarten class. Are you a teacher here?

77
00:04:42.533 --> 00:04:45.833
Yes. Did everybody behave while I was out?

78
00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.599
Yes, ma'am. We've all been really good.

79
00:04:48.666 --> 00:04:51.966
So what kind of Pokémon did you bring here for us today?

80
00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:56.433
Wow, Pikachu!

81
00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.233
Look at that. You brought us a Pikachu to play with today!

82
00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.300
- Play with today?
- So neat!

83
00:05:02.366 --> 00:05:05.066
I've never ever seen a Pikachu before in person.

84
00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:08.566
- Neither have I.
- Pi! Pika!

85
00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:12.500
- Look. There's a Froakie, too.
- Froakie.

86
00:05:12.566 --> 00:05:16.800
Welcome back. It looks like you brought Pokémon with Trainers today.

87
00:05:16.866 --> 00:05:20.000
That's right, I did. It's something new.

88
00:05:20.066 --> 00:05:23.200
We ran into Ash and his friends when we were in out in the woods.

89
00:05:23.266 --> 00:05:25.733
How nice of you to come!

90
00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.766
You see, my Sylveon and I go out into the fields and forests every day

91
00:05:29.833 --> 00:05:32.233
and the two of us make friends with wild Pokémon

92
00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.333
and then we bring them back here with us.

93
00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.166
We do this so the children can meet and learn all about them.

94
00:05:38.233 --> 00:05:39.866
Interesting.

95
00:05:39.933 --> 00:05:42.800
You could have just told us that right from the start.

96
00:05:42.866 --> 00:05:45.033
- Right, buddy?
- Pika.

97
00:05:45.099 --> 00:05:48.266
Oh, so that's why Penelope wanted Ash to come here with her.

98
00:05:49.566 --> 00:05:51.466
Fro?

99
00:05:56.166 --> 00:05:59.533
So the Twerps are busy visiting a kindergarten, eh?

100
00:05:59.599 --> 00:06:01.166
What a twerpish waste of time.

101
00:06:01.233 --> 00:06:05.966
Wow! That Sylveon's really cute. My heart's melting like a candle.

102
00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:10.433
Meowth. Don't tell me that Attract worked on you, too.

103
00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.500
-Wobbuffet!

104
00:06:12.566 --> 00:06:15.099
You're right and I'd better snap out of it pronto.

105
00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:18.833
But that doesn't mean they don't have a total cutie pie there!

106
00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.566
What a moosh head!

107
00:06:20.633 --> 00:06:23.500
Regardless, today's the day we grab Pikachu.

108
00:06:23.566 --> 00:06:26.333
And let's grab that Sylveon while we're at it, too.

109
00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:30.500
- Right. It's Operation Doubleheader.
- Wobbuffet!

110
00:06:35.166 --> 00:06:38.500
- Can I pet Pikachu, please?
- Yeah, of course.

111
00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:42.700
- Wow, it's so soft.
- It sure is.

112
00:06:42.766 --> 00:06:45.766
I didn't know Pikachu's tail was all pointy like that.

113
00:06:45.833 --> 00:06:48.700
Ooh! Pikachu likes it when you pet its tail.

114
00:06:48.766 --> 00:06:53.066
- Really?
- Pika!

115
00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.599
Since we're all here, you're most welcome to play

116
00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:57.966
with my Pokémon as well, if you'd like.

117
00:06:58.033 --> 00:07:01.233
- Really?
- Wow, that's a great idea, Clemont.

118
00:07:01.299 --> 00:07:03.833
I'm sure more Pokémon will be more fun.

119
00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.933
- Thanks so much.
- Come on out, everybody!

120
00:07:08.233 --> 00:07:11.533
- Fletch! Fletchling!
- Fennekin!

121
00:07:11.599 --> 00:07:14.866
- Ches-pipin!
- Bunnelby.

122
00:07:14.933 --> 00:07:17.700
- Wow!
- Look, it's a Fletchling!

123
00:07:17.766 --> 00:07:21.066
And a Fennekin and a Bunnelby and even a Chespin.

124
00:07:21.133 --> 00:07:24.633
- And here is my friend, Dedenne!
- Dedenne!

125
00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:27.866
-Huh?

126
00:07:27.933 --> 00:07:32.633
- Hey, who was that?
- That's Randall. I'll go call him.

127
00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.500
Randall loves Pokémon as much as the other children.

128
00:07:35.566 --> 00:07:37.866
He's just a little shy, that's all.

129
00:07:38.866 --> 00:07:42.533
- Oh!
- Fennekin's fur is so soft!

130
00:07:42.599 --> 00:07:46.266
Thank you. That's because I brush Fennekin every single day.

131
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:47.833
- Right?
- Yeah.

132
00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.266
I can't believe how big Bunnelby's ears are.

133
00:07:51.333 --> 00:07:53.500
And Bunnelby's ears are very strong.

134
00:07:53.566 --> 00:07:55.833
- Bunnelby, use Dig.
- Dig!

135
00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.733
Bunn!

136
00:08:01.733 --> 00:08:03.400
Wow!

137
00:08:03.466 --> 00:08:07.166
Might be prickly.

138
00:08:07.233 --> 00:08:08.633
Yeah, pet.

139
00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.633
It feels weird, but it feels kind of nice, too.

140
00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:16.400
That's right. You just have to be gentle. Chespin really loves to be petted.

141
00:08:16.466 --> 00:08:17.866
- Yeah.
- Aw!

142
00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:23.433
See, isn't Dedenne a cutie?

143
00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.366
- Here you go, Fletchling.
- Fletch!

144
00:08:25.433 --> 00:08:29.599
- And Sylveon, you too.
- Sylve!

145
00:08:29.666 --> 00:08:32.600
- Eon?
- Kie? Fro.

146
00:08:32.666 --> 00:08:34.766
Is something wrong with Froakie?

147
00:08:34.833 --> 00:08:37.333
It's because it lost the battle to Sylveon.

148
00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:41.266
I think Froakie's a little embarrassed about the Attract.

149
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:45.433
- Froakie, it's over and done with.
- Fro! Fro!

150
00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.766
See? Look at all the Pokémon.

151
00:08:48.733 --> 00:08:51.266
Mm. Uh, yeah.

152
00:08:51.333 --> 00:08:55.000
Your name's Randall, right? My name's Ash.

153
00:08:55.066 --> 00:08:57.800
Randall, how would you like to make friends with Froakie?

154
00:08:57.866 --> 00:09:01.199
- Kie! Kie!
- Huh? Uh...

155
00:09:01.266 --> 00:09:03.800
- Froakie's not going to hurt you.
- Froakie.

156
00:09:03.866 --> 00:09:06.400
I'm... kind of scared.

157
00:09:06.466 --> 00:09:10.500
- Why don't you try to feed Froakie?
- No way! I'm scared!

158
00:09:10.566 --> 00:09:12.533
Oh. It's okay.

159
00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.500
- Watch what I do, Randall.
- Nenne.

160
00:09:15.566 --> 00:09:18.333
Those Pokémon don't fool me.

161
00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.766
I'm not dumb. You never know what they'll do.

162
00:09:23.966 --> 00:09:27.133
- Hoppip. Hoppip-hop.
- Huh?

163
00:09:27.199 --> 00:09:31.366
- Hop-hop.
- It's a Hoppip!

164
00:09:31.433 --> 00:09:38.433
Huh. Huh?

165
00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.166
Hop-Hoppip!

166
00:09:43.733 --> 00:09:46.400
-Hoppip! Hop!

167
00:09:50.366 --> 00:09:55.066
All I wanted was for Hoppip and me to be friends. It was awful.

168
00:09:55.133 --> 00:09:57.300
I'm sorry that happened to you.

169
00:09:57.366 --> 00:10:00.266
Maybe something happened that caused Hoppip to become frightened.

170
00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:04.100
Sometimes not knowing what a Pokémon's going to do can be lots of fun!

171
00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:06.633
- Huh?
- Try not to let them scare you so much.

172
00:10:06.699 --> 00:10:08.733
- Pikachu.
- But how?

173
00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:13.633
I can't help how I feel. I can't! They'll never be my friends.

174
00:10:13.699 --> 00:10:15.933
- Huh?

175
00:10:21.266 --> 00:10:24.166
Well. Hello there, all you boys and girls.

176
00:10:24.233 --> 00:10:28.033
We put together a super-duper show for all of you cutie kiddies!

177
00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.533
Get ready for a great time.

178
00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:36.033
- Let's go, Randall.
- Okay.

179
00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:40.199
What is this? Did you ask those folks to come here?

180
00:10:40.266 --> 00:10:41.766
No, I didn't.

181
00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:44.433
One of our favorite pastimes is volunteering

182
00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:47.266
to travel around and entertain all you children.

183
00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:49.866
- All right! Can I try it too?
- Pikachu!

184
00:10:49.933 --> 00:10:54.699
Of course! You're all welcome! The more, the merrier, I always say.

185
00:10:54.766 --> 00:10:57.300
Wow, that's awesome! Let's try it, Randall.

186
00:10:57.366 --> 00:11:00.766
- I know we'll have a great time.
- But I...

187
00:11:00.833 --> 00:11:02.933
-You're all our special guests.

188
00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.500
So, people and Pokémon, right this way to the stage!

189
00:11:10.699 --> 00:11:15.400
All righty, then! Everybody gets one of these balls.

190
00:11:15.466 --> 00:11:18.500
With these things, even a beginner can play along.

191
00:11:18.566 --> 00:11:21.533
That means everyone!

192
00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:28.033
- Did everyone get a ball?

193
00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.733
Yes!

194
00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:34.133
All right, let's go. On the count of three, throw your ball up high!

195
00:11:34.199 --> 00:11:37.066
And one, two, three!

196
00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.566
Who's that Pokémon?

197
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.166
It's Sylveon!

198
00:11:57.666 --> 00:11:59.933
What?!

199
00:12:01.566 --> 00:12:04.433
Huh?

200
00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.966
Huh? Oh no! What happened?

201
00:12:08.033 --> 00:12:10.199
Oh! What's going on here?

202
00:12:10.266 --> 00:12:12.800
I don't see those entertainers anywhere.

203
00:12:12.866 --> 00:12:15.466
- Me neither.
- Let's get off the stage!

204
00:12:15.533 --> 00:12:17.266
Everyone, watch your step!

205
00:12:17.333 --> 00:12:19.500
- Pika! Pika!
- Eon!

206
00:12:19.566 --> 00:12:21.733
Come on, this way!

207
00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:25.166
Is everybody all right?

208
00:12:25.233 --> 00:12:27.833
Everybody off the stage?

209
00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:31.033
Pika?

210
00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.633
Ash! Are you all right?

211
00:12:33.699 --> 00:12:36.833
- What was that?
- Where did Sylveon go?

212
00:12:40.099 --> 00:12:42.266
Prepare for trouble, what's going on is us.

213
00:12:42.333 --> 00:12:44.500
And make it double, being us is a plus.

214
00:12:44.566 --> 00:12:47.000
To protect the world from devastation.

215
00:12:47.066 --> 00:12:49.866
To unite all people within our nation.

216
00:12:49.933 --> 00:12:52.733
To denounce the evils of truth and love.

217
00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:56.300
To extend our reach to the stars above.

218
00:12:56.366 --> 00:12:58.066
- Jessie!
- And James.

219
00:12:58.133 --> 00:13:01.333
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

220
00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:04.533
Surrender now or prepare for a totally grown-up fight.

221
00:13:04.599 --> 00:13:08.266
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

222
00:13:09.366 --> 00:13:11.199
- Team Rocket?
- Ugh.

223
00:13:11.266 --> 00:13:14.266
They're bad guys who love to steal other people's Pokémon.

224
00:13:14.333 --> 00:13:16.500
Give back Pikachu and Sylveon!

225
00:13:16.566 --> 00:13:18.866
Just as soon as you stop being a Twerp.

226
00:13:18.933 --> 00:13:23.133
Which is never. After all, stealing other people's Pokémon is a one-way street.

227
00:13:23.199 --> 00:13:25.199
In we go!

228
00:13:25.266 --> 00:13:28.933
-We have ignition, so watch this rig roll.

229
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.533
Come back! Pikachu, Sylveon!

230
00:13:32.599 --> 00:13:35.133
Stop now!

231
00:13:36.766 --> 00:13:38.133
Fletchling! Fletch! Fletch!

232
00:13:38.199 --> 00:13:39.766
Oh, no, Ash!

233
00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:42.133
- Randall? Randall, where are you?
- Huh?

234
00:13:42.199 --> 00:13:44.000
Where is he?

235
00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:47.699
Where's Randall?

236
00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:55.466
Huh?

237
00:13:55.533 --> 00:13:59.933
Such persistence. Try this on for size.

238
00:14:00.066 --> 00:14:02.500
- Fletchling!
- Fletch! Fletch!

239
00:14:02.566 --> 00:14:04.733
It's going to need a washcloth.

240
00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:08.466
Which leaves Pikachu and Sylveon all for us. Bye, bye!

241
00:14:08.533 --> 00:14:10.633
Wobba!

242
00:14:10.699 --> 00:14:13.000
We're moving. Where to?

243
00:14:14.333 --> 00:14:16.500
It's awfully dark in here.

244
00:14:16.566 --> 00:14:20.599
-Pikachu!

245
00:14:20.666 --> 00:14:22.533
- Pikachu! Sylveon!
- Froakie. Froakie!

246
00:14:24.033 --> 00:14:26.566
Hang in there!

247
00:14:31.633 --> 00:14:35.166
- Randall, where are you?
- Hey! hey, Randall!

248
00:14:35.233 --> 00:14:39.366
- I don't see him anywhere.
- Where could he have gone?

249
00:14:40.366 --> 00:14:41.866
Could it be that...

250
00:14:41.933 --> 00:14:45.066
Yeah. Maybe he didn't get off the stage in time.

251
00:14:45.133 --> 00:14:47.833
So that would mean Randall's still in the truck.

252
00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.833
I've got to rescue him.

253
00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:53.033
Would you please watch the other children while I'm gone?

254
00:14:53.099 --> 00:14:55.900
- Of course.
- I'm coming with you, Penelope.

255
00:14:55.966 --> 00:14:58.266
- We want to go with you, too.
- Right.

256
00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:03.233
-Oh.

257
00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:05.233
Froakie! Kie-kie.

258
00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.000
- Pikachu!
- Sylve?

259
00:15:08.066 --> 00:15:11.733
Froak! Froakie!

260
00:15:13.033 --> 00:15:15.733
Pika...

261
00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.466
Oh! Huh?

262
00:15:19.666 --> 00:15:21.900
Huh? Randall, Froakie, what are you doing here?

263
00:15:21.966 --> 00:15:25.800
It's Ash!

264
00:15:25.866 --> 00:15:30.533
Don't worry. I'm here, so everything will be okay.

265
00:15:30.599 --> 00:15:35.333
Pikachu, Sylveon, let's get you out of there right away!

266
00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:41.066
Fletch! Fletch... Fletch?

267
00:15:41.133 --> 00:15:46.400
Fletchling! Oh! What happened? And where is everybody else?

268
00:15:50.333 --> 00:15:52.633
Okay, Froakie, help me get them out of here.

269
00:15:52.699 --> 00:15:55.366
- Froak.
- Ready?

270
00:15:55.433 --> 00:15:58.333
Again!

271
00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.566
- Man, the cases are tough!
- Fro! Fro!

272
00:16:02.633 --> 00:16:06.733
- Randall. Help us out too, okay?
- Huh?

273
00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.633
Pikachu and Sylveon are counting on you.

274
00:16:13.966 --> 00:16:17.733
I'm scared. I can't help anyone. I don't know what to do.

275
00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.466
Of course you can help.

276
00:16:19.533 --> 00:16:23.033
If we all work together, I know we can get them out of there.

277
00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:26.666
Huh? Poor Sylveon.

278
00:16:29.233 --> 00:16:33.900
Sylveon's Miss Penelope's Pokémon, her friend, and it's my friend too.

279
00:16:33.966 --> 00:16:38.900
- Yeah, that's right, Randall.
- I want to help. Huh?

280
00:16:38.966 --> 00:16:40.900
That's what I like to hear.

281
00:16:40.966 --> 00:16:43.900
Thanks!

282
00:16:43.966 --> 00:16:45.966
- Let's go!
- Froak.

283
00:16:46.033 --> 00:16:47.566
- Yeah!
- Froak.

284
00:16:47.633 --> 00:16:50.566
Oh!

285
00:16:51.633 --> 00:16:53.133
Just a little more!

286
00:16:56.133 --> 00:16:58.166
All right!

287
00:16:58.233 --> 00:17:01.133
Huh?

288
00:17:01.199 --> 00:17:03.233
Kie. Fro.

289
00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:06.666
- Huh?
- Sylveon.

290
00:17:06.733 --> 00:17:07.899
Oh.

291
00:17:07.966 --> 00:17:09.966
Sylveon's saying thank you.

292
00:17:10.033 --> 00:17:12.500
Aw!

293
00:17:12.566 --> 00:17:14.233
Sylveon, thanks!

294
00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.733
Sylveon! Syl!

295
00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.800
Syl.

296
00:17:21.866 --> 00:17:24.333
-Pikachu! Pikachu!

297
00:17:24.399 --> 00:17:27.566
- All right, let's get Pikachu out, too.
- Right.

298
00:17:27.633 --> 00:17:30.033
Ready?

299
00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:36.200
- Pikachu!
- Pikachu!

300
00:17:36.266 --> 00:17:39.933
- Hey. You all right, buddy?
- Pikachu.

301
00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.333
- Wow. That's great, Pikachu.
- Fro!

302
00:17:51.233 --> 00:17:53.933
Okay. We're here.

303
00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.533
Now that we've got Pikachu and Sylveon,

304
00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.866
what do you say we give the Boss a ringie-dingie?

305
00:17:58.933 --> 00:18:01.866
Dig! Look out, six-figure raise.

306
00:18:01.933 --> 00:18:04.100
These are our glory days.

307
00:18:04.166 --> 00:18:07.533
Huh? There's a twerp in our truck!

308
00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.800
-You won't sell!

309
00:18:09.866 --> 00:18:12.399
Huh? Wobba!

310
00:18:12.466 --> 00:18:16.166
All right, I'm taking Pikachu and Sylveon back.

311
00:18:16.233 --> 00:18:19.500
- Not on our watch!
- Pumpkaboo, I need you!

312
00:18:19.566 --> 00:18:23.766
- Okay, Inkay, you too.
- Inkay!

313
00:18:23.833 --> 00:18:26.433
- Shadow Ball, go!
- Inkay, Psybeam!

314
00:18:30.666 --> 00:18:34.033
-Froakie! Water Pulse, let's go!

315
00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.399
Pikachu, you use Thunderbolt!

316
00:18:36.466 --> 00:18:40.433
- Pikachu!
- Froakie!

317
00:18:42.833 --> 00:18:45.366
Now, Pikachu, Electro Ball!

318
00:18:45.433 --> 00:18:47.866
Pika! Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

319
00:18:51.133 --> 00:18:55.166
We're blasting off again!

320
00:18:55.233 --> 00:18:57.533
- Wobbuffet!
- Inkay!

321
00:19:01.733 --> 00:19:04.433
- Fletchling! Fletch!
- Fletchling!

322
00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.033
- Huh?

323
00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:12.000
Ash! Everybody! You're all okay!

324
00:19:12.066 --> 00:19:14.600
Yeah!

325
00:19:17.366 --> 00:19:20.500
And guess what? I helped save Pikachu and Sylveon.

326
00:19:20.566 --> 00:19:22.233
You did, Randall?

327
00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.833
No kidding? So cool!

328
00:19:27.666 --> 00:19:31.800
Hey, Ash, do you think Froakie and I are going to be good friends now?

329
00:19:31.866 --> 00:19:35.000
Of course. Froakie and I are both going to be your friends forever.

330
00:19:35.066 --> 00:19:36.733
And you can count on it.

331
00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.200
- Kie!
- Huh?

332
00:19:40.233 --> 00:19:44.033
-Wow, Randall! You're not afraid!

333
00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:47.233
- Yeah, way to go, Randall!
- Thanks!

334
00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.666
When I get bigger, I want to be a Pokémon Trainer, too.

335
00:19:54.733 --> 00:19:58.399
And then, know what, I'll go on a journey with a friend like Froakie.

336
00:19:58.466 --> 00:20:02.300
Awesome! And the next time I see you, we'll have a battle, okay?

337
00:20:02.366 --> 00:20:03.899
Froakie! Kie!

338
00:20:03.966 --> 00:20:07.200
Uh-huh. It's a deal, Ash!

339
00:20:07.266 --> 00:20:08.933
Great.

340
00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:11.100
Okay, time for us to go.

341
00:20:11.166 --> 00:20:13.466
We owe all of you so very much.

342
00:20:13.533 --> 00:20:15.300
Thanks for everything.

343
00:20:15.366 --> 00:20:17.666
Have a safe journey!

344
00:20:17.733 --> 00:20:20.033
Sylveon!

345
00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:22.266
Thanks! Take care, everyone.

346
00:20:22.333 --> 00:20:23.933
Pika! Pika!

347
00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.000
Bye! Take care!

348
00:20:26.066 --> 00:20:28.433
- Bye-bye!
- Ne! Ne!

349
00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:33.433
Bye-bye!

350
00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.233
And so, our heroes have some new friends,

351
00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:39.966
Penelope, Randall and the Fairy-type Pokémon Sylveon.

352
00:20:40.033 --> 00:20:42.733
Lasting friendships, life-changing adventures

353
00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.666
and lots of fun, as the journey continues!
